==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Send out [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catyphoon]] as soon as you can afford him, and then use Maglev Cat to snipe the first Shibalien Elite so it doesn't block Catyphoon's way. Once Metal Hippoe is dead, send out Awakened Bahamut for an easy victory.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Send out Catyphoon when you can afford him, once he kills the first 2 Metal Hippoes send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] once you can afford him and he will destroy the base even if the Great Angel Chibinels come out.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Resist your instinct to send a critter for the Metal Hippoe. Instead, wait for Lophiiformes Angaburu to spawn, then use the Metal Hippoe as a stepping stone for [[Talents|Talented]] Awakened Bahamut Cat to take everything out. Once Angaburu is dealt with, you are free to send a critter and complete the stage. Other units with piercing, such as [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]], are a nice DPS bonus.

