==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Canopus|Canopus]] is the brightest star in the constellation [[wikipedia:Carina (constellation)|Carina]] and the 2nd brightest star in the night sky. ''Carina'' is Latin for the keel of a ship, which is why Canopus's [[Treasure]] is a Keel.
**Canopus having a bird on its base may be because [[wikipedia:Keel (bird anatomy)|''carina'' and ''keel'']] can also refer to an extension of the sternum to which flying birds' wing muscles are attached.
**The running, chicken-like bird may be a reference to the [[wikipedia:IC 2944|Running Chicken Nebula]], although this nebula is found in the constellation [[wikipedia:Centaurus|Centaurus]], not Carina.
*Since it has plane wings, the bird can be seen as an inversion of [[wikipedia:Ornithopter|ornithopters]], aircrafts which are designed to fly in imitation of how birds flap their wings and are well known for their prominence in the ''[[wikipedia:Dune (franchise)|Dune]]'' franchise, whose setting, [[wikipedia:Arrakis|Arrakis]], orbits Canopus.

